<div class="wd-block" data-line="5" data-end-line="5" data-key="1a0atd7roy134">
  <h1 id="quantum-flow-architecture--api-specifications">Quantum Flow: Architecture &amp; API Specifications</h1>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="7" data-end-line="8" data-key="1v3sa6wzk6c74">
  <div class="callout callout-note">
    <p class="callout-title"><span class="callout-icon" data-icon="info"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span>Note</p>
    <p>High-throughput zero-copy serialization protocol optimized for Apple Silicon neural fabrics and Darwin memory subsystems.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="10" data-end-line="10" data-key="1dxk6fqljh61l">
  <h2 id="1-executive-overview">1. Executive Overview</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="11" data-end-line="11" data-key="nbpz7t95v66w">
  <p>Quantum Flow implements an ultra-low latency IPC bus using <strong>shared-memory rings</strong> and <em>lock-free atomic queues</em>. Legacy protocols are <del>deprecated for v3.0</del> in favor of direct hardware-accelerated memory fences.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="13" data-end-line="13" data-key="m500tii0yo22">
  <h3 id="sprint-implementation-roadmap">Sprint Implementation Roadmap</h3>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="14" data-end-line="17" data-key="1md6j322usvvk">
  <ul class="contains-task-list">
    <li class="task-list-item is-checked" data-wd-rl="0" data-line="14"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" aria-label="Define protocol buffer schema definition &amp; IDL bindings" data-wd-trl="0" data-task-line="14"></span>Define protocol buffer schema definition &amp; IDL bindings</li>
    <li class="task-list-item is-checked" data-wd-rl="1" data-line="15"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" aria-label="Memory lock IPC sockets across Darwin kernel domains" data-wd-trl="1" data-task-line="15"></span>Memory lock IPC sockets across Darwin kernel domains</li>
    <li class="task-list-item" data-wd-rl="2" data-line="16"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" aria-label="Benchmarking latency target (p99 < 1.2ms) with 64KB payloads" data-wd-trl="2" data-task-line="16"></span>Benchmarking latency target (p99 &lt; 1.2ms) with 64KB payloads</li>
    <li class="task-list-item" data-wd-rl="3" data-line="17"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" aria-label="Realtime telemetry pipeline integration" data-wd-trl="3" data-task-line="17"></span>Realtime telemetry pipeline integration</li>
  </ul>
</div>
